# Normalize line endings so a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) cannot
# silently convert files to CRLF. Shell scripts in particular are COPY'd
# verbatim into Linux Docker images; a CRLF shebang line makes the
# interpreter unresolvable at container start ("exec ...: no such file or
# directory"), regardless of which compose.*.yaml built the image.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
